{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is approached, take it, check object properties. If object is visible, move to it. Scan area for object.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToTheObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
